# 簡報：只公開工具與範本，含客戶與內部資訊的簡報內容留在本機
docs/slides/**/node_modules/
docs/slides/**/dist/
docs/slides/terraform-split/
docs/slides/open-slide-redesign/slides/*/
!docs/slides/open-slide-redesign/slides/getting-started/
.terraform/
.terraform-*/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
# .cache without a slash also matches the symlink a worktree uses to share the main checkout's cache.
.cache
modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl

